DAY-04:

PIPELINE: 
Series of events interlinked with each other.
Step-by-step execution of a process.

TYPES:
1. SCRIPTED
2. DECLARTIVE  -- > SHORTCUT: PASSS


examples:

pipeline {
    agent any 
    
    stages {
        stage('one') {
            steps {
                sh 'touch file1'
            }
        }
    }
}

