Job Structure:

GENERAL
│
├── Restrict where this project can be run
│   └── Label: dev
│
SOURCE CODE MANAGEMENT
│
├── Git
│   ├── Repository URL
│   ├── Credentials
│   └── Branch: */main
│
TRIGGERS
│
└── GitHub hook trigger / Poll SCM
│
BUILD STEPS
│
├── Invoke top-level Maven targets
│   ├── Maven: MyMaven
│   └── Goals: clean package
│
└── Nexus artifact uploader
    ├── Nexus 3
    ├── Nexus URL
    ├── NexusCredentials
    ├── GroupId
    ├── ArtifactId
    ├── Version
    ├── Type: war
    └── File: target/myapp.war
│
POST-BUILD ACTIONS
│
└── Deploy war/ear to a container
    ├── WAR: target/myapp.war
    ├── Context path: /myapp
    ├── Container: Tomcat 9.x Remote
    ├── Credentials: TomcatCredentials
    └── Tomcat URL

